/* 品牌基础样式：深绿 #0B3D2E 底、奶油 #F5EFDC 字、黄铜 #B5A642 点缀。页面样式只做局部覆盖。 */
page {
  background: #0B3D2E;
  color: #F5EFDC;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 24rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.card {
  background: rgba(245, 239, 220, 0.06);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(181, 166, 66, 0.35);
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  padding: 24rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
}

.card-title {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: #B5A642;
  margin-bottom: 12rpx;
}

.btn {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 24rpx 0;
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(181, 166, 66, 0.4);
  background: rgba(245, 239, 220, 0.1);
  color: #F5EFDC;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  text-align: center;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.btn::after {
  border: none;
}

.btn-primary {
  background: #B5A642;
  color: #0B3D2E;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.btn[disabled] {
  opacity: 0.45;
}

.row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.muted {
  color: rgba(245, 239, 220, 0.62);
  font-size: 24rpx;
}

.brass {
  color: #B5A642;
}

.danger {
  color: #E4786C;
}

.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 2rpx 12rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(181, 166, 66, 0.5);
  color: #B5A642;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

.input {
  background: rgba(245, 239, 220, 0.08);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(181, 166, 66, 0.35);
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  padding: 18rpx;
  color: #F5EFDC;
}

.notice {
  background: rgba(181, 166, 66, 0.14);
  border-left: 6rpx solid #B5A642;
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  padding: 16rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
}

.error {
  color: #E4786C;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  margin-top: 12rpx;
}
